{"id":"kollege","lemma":"Kollege","pos":"noun","rank":1283,"glosses":["colleague, coworker, workmate, fellow worker or member","buddy, mate, homie (usually male, sense is rare in the feminine form)"],"ipa":"/kɔˈleːɡə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0e/De-Kollege2.ogg/De-Kollege2.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Kollegen","plural":"Kollegen","feminine":"Kollegin"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir sind Kollegen, nichts weiter.","en":"We're colleagues, nothing more.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"further, farther, more"}]},{"text":"Er ist mein Kollege.","en":"He's my colleague.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Ist dein Kollege Amerikaner?","en":"Is your coworker an American?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"American )"}]},{"text":"Viele meiner Kollegen mag ich nicht.","en":"I don't like many of the people I work with.","words":[{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Meine Kollegin und ihr Mann sind beide Amerikaner.","en":"My colleague and her husband are both American.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"both"},{"g":"American )"}]}]}